    "millsfield:images_texts": [
      "AIR\nCALIFORNIA\nTIMETABLE\nEffective September 5, 1978\nSERVING LAKE TAHOE, MONTEREY/SALINAS, OAKLAND,\nONTARIO, ORANGE COUNTY, PALM SPRINGS, SACRAMENTO,\nSAN DIEGO, SAN FRANCISCO AND SAN JOSE.",
      "Air California\nputs Monterey/Salinas\nwithin easy reach.\nYou must stand overlooking Point Lobos on the Monterey\nPeninsula to understand why it's called the greatest\nmeeting of land and water in the world.\" And now it's easy to\nretreat to the unique blend of natural beauty and quiet\nseclusion that brings travelers from all over the world again\nand again to Monterey.\nConvenient Air California flights will link Monterey with six\nNorthern and Southern California regional airports. It's yours\nfor a memorable vacation, a refreshing weekend or an\nincomparable business environment. We make the getting\nthere quick and economical. So you can make the most\nof Monterey's nearly limitless pleasures. Stay in a luxurious\nbeachfront hotel or a secluded little cottage. Play the superb\ncourses of the golf capital of the world. Shop for hand-crafted\ntreasurers. Take a walking tour into California history and\ntravel the famed Seventeen Mile Drive. Choose from hundreds\nof delightful restaurants. Discover\npicture perfect scenes and storiec\nplaces... Cannery Row, the\nButterfly Trees, Laguna Seca,\nCarmel, The Lone Cypress, Pebble\nBeach. Plan now to experience\nit all for yourself. Call Air California\nor your travel agent. Monterey is at\nlast within easy reach"
    ],
